  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest restaurant you encounter en route to ABQ BioPark (Botanic Garden), Albuquerque, NM from Wildlife West Nature Park, Edgewood, NM?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.202309 35.071827)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.680854 35.09327)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.202309 35.071827)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-106.202309 35.071827)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
